        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRay Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this bright and spacious one bedroom, one bathroom studio to the market in the popular Kilmacredock area.\nLocated just minutes from Maynooth Village, the property is well positioned for access to local amenities, public transport and the M4 motorway. Dublin Bus and Leixlip Train Station are both nearby, with Intel also less than 1km away.\nThe accommodation comprises an open-plan kitchen/dining area, spacious bedroom and generous bathroom. The property is furnished and presented in excellent condition throughout.\nHeating, electricity and bins are included in the rent.\n\nKey Features:\n• 1 bed / 1 bath\n• Furnished\n• Heating, electricity & bins included\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• High-grade appliances\n• Bright and spacious accommodation\n• Excellent transport links\n• Close to Maynooth Village\n• Easy access to M4 motorway\n• Less than 1km from Intel\nViewing is highly recommended."
